# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# The repo's deployment is `python3 -m http.server` over a `COPY . .` of the
# repo root — there is no build step in CI. The built dist/ folder MUST be
# committed for Cogfall to actually deploy at /games/cogfall/dist/.
# Run `npm run build` and commit the output.
